Dear  Tours & Travel Partner

Warm greetings from Ciala Resort

We hope this email finds you well.  I'm reaching out on behalf of Ciala
Resort, a premier luxury destination nestled in the heart of Kisumu County.
We would like to take this opportunity to introduce ourselves to your
esteemed travel agency and explore potential collaboration opportunities
that will mutually benefit our clients and businesses.

Ciala Resort offers an exceptional blend of comfort, elegance, and unique
experiences. Whether it's for leisure, business, events, or family getaways,
our resort provides a perfect environment with top-tier amenities, fine
dining, tranquil accommodations, conference facilities, and warm Kenyan
hospitality.

As we approach the festive season, we're excited to share our special Easter
package, curated to offer unforgettable holiday experiences for families,
couples, and groups. The package includes:

*	Luxurious accommodation with breakfast
*	Easter-themed family activities
*	Live entertainment and themed dinners
*	Special offers for group bookings and extended stays

We believe that with your expertise and our premium offerings, we can create
memorable travel experiences for your clients. We would love the opportunity
to partner with you, and we're happy to share more details, rates, and
promotional materials upon request.

Let's connect and make this Easter-and every stay-special for your
travellers.

Looking forward to working together!

Warm regards,

 




 

|MAUREEN  - Sales and Marketing Manager | 

